Dear managers...

We just had a crash on our alphastation 200 running OSF/1 V3.2-214.

The panic string is: "pmap_remove_range: page wired".
This smells like a bug in OSF/1 kernel. Has anyone seen this before?
I've seen other "pmap" related panic messages in the 
alpha-osf-managers mailing list and in each case, patches were indciated.
Is there a patch for this one?...

I attach the crash-data file below:

thanks

Charlie Jui
